stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> PendingJudgment : submit to Guardian
  PendingJudgment --> Ready : Guardian PASS/WARN
  PendingJudgment --> Quarantined : Guardian BLOCK
  Ready --> PendingReview : Operator submits for review
  PendingReview --> Approved : Reviewer APPROVE
  PendingReview --> ChangesRequested : Reviewer REJECT
  Approved --> Signed : Document Signer completes
  Signed --> Released : Portal release (ExclusiveSwap)
  Released --> Revoked : New deliverable approved / compliance action
  Revoked --> Archived : Retention / case closure
  ChangesRequested --> Draft : Operator revises
  Quarantined --> Draft : Remediation
